<title>USA: Journal.</title>
<headline>Journal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Association of Retired Persons will start to market a variable annuity product underwritten by Hartford Life next month, the Wall Street Journal said in Thursday's electronic edition.</p>
<p>The product would be designed specifically for AARP's 33 million members, the paper said.</p>
<p>Hartford Life is a unit of ITT Hartford Group.</p>
